[232.269872, "o", "`replay.min_interval_s` between runs. Keep the payments-owned refund-storm guards in\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> `config/refunds.json` in place (20 events per run, 120 seconds between runs).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The local backlog command and the permission-checked internal replay endpoint are the\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> supported replay paths. Public webhook requests always require a valid, fresh\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> `Paygate-Signature`; a replay-token header does not bypass signature verification.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
